WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
10:00 — Home at large text. She opens the vault with text large enough to read without glasses — reminders show policy renewals clearly.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
14:20 — Documents. Pension letters and insurance schedules are tagged — search beats hunting through folders in two rooms.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
16:00 — Renewal reminder. A reminder nudges her two weeks before home insurance renews — she sets a note for the call centre.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
19:30 — Settings at large text. She keeps Larger Text on and checks that demo mode is clearly labelled before handing the phone to her son.

